38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"- **Misaki**: I found the fuel receipts. Two of us bought over half the litres, and one barely shows up.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minato,,"- **Minato**: I found the tax and insurance papers. It was over 280,000 yen before fuel. That is a lot of guessing.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,George,,"- **George**: That checking spell was the worst part. We felt accused, and the checker had to apologize. We must avoid that trap.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,- **Toshio**: The diary shows Saturdays are triple Tuesdays. The trial recording took an hour weekly. That is the hidden cost.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Victoria,,- **Victoria**: The handover state is poor; fuel light on and rubbish inside. The weekly trips keep collapsing at short notice.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"- **Misaki**: The diary confirms Saturdays are triple Tuesdays. An even split ignores that gap, so it isn't truly fair.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minato,,"- **Minato**: @Toshio, an hour a week is a lot. @Misaki, if Saturdays are triple, the split isn't fair.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,George,,"- **George**: @Toshio, that hour a week is exactly the friction I feared. We must design a system that removes the need for constant checking.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"- **Toshio**: @George, agreed. The recording trial proved the manual method is too heavy. We need a system that doesn't require constant verification.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"- **Victoria**: @George, the weekly trips collapsing is the real danger. I need a system that guarantees those slots are actually held.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"- **Misaki**: @George, I agree. The uneven usage means a flat split is unfair. We need to account for the actual hours driven.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minato,,"@George, I agree. We need a system that is simple and fair, so we don’t have to keep checking on each other.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,George,,"- **George**: @Victoria, @Misaki, @Minato, we have the facts. Now we need a way to stop the asking and the checking.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Misaki"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"- **Toshio**: @George, exactly. The data shows manual tracking is unsustainable. We need a structure that handles the imbalance automatically.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"- **Victoria**: @George, I agree. We need a structure that guarantees the car is ready and the weekly slots are protected.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"- **Misaki**: @George, I agree. We need a structure that reflects the real usage, not just a flat assumption.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minato,,"@George, I agree. If we know the real costs and who drives, we can stop guessing and just be fair.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
